# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Client matter data must never enter this repository.
#
# The skill writes every matter into `matters/<date>_<slug>/`. That is real
# contract data belonging to real counterparties. It stays local, always.
# These rules are deliberately broad — a false positive costs you one `git add
# -f`, a false negative publishes someone's agreement.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

